OPEN MISSING
  IN MISSING-ERR, STATUS 35
AFTER, STATUS 35
READ 1 00
  IN INPUT-ERR, STATUS 10
READ 2 (AT END, NO AT END PHRASE) 10
  IN INPUT-ERR, STATUS 46
  IN REL-ERR, STATUS 22
DUP WRITE 22
INVALID KEY PHRASE 22
  IN NOSTAT-ERR (NO FILE STATUS CLAUSE)
STILL RUNNING AFTER NOSTAT
  IN OUTPUT-ERR, STATUS 47
READ ON OUTPUT 47
ERRORS HANDLED 06
rc=0
